---
title: Halal cart chicken and rice
servings: 4
yield: 4 to 6 servings
tags: [middle eastern, chicken]
cuisine: middle eastern
time: 5 hours 15 minutes
source: Halal Cart-Style Chicken and Rice by Caroline Russock and J. Kenji López-Alt, Serious Eats, https://www.seriouseats.com/serious-eats-halal-cart-style-chicken-and-rice-white-sauce-recipe
nutrition:
  calories: 964 kcal
  fat: 53 g
  saturated fat: 13 g
